Package: sppdata
Title: Access to the Subnational Politics Project (SPP) Datasets
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Guadalupe", "Gonzalez", email = "guada@example.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Agustina", "Giraudy", role = "aut"),
    person("Francisco", "Urdinez", role = "aut"),
    person("Felipe", "Soto Jorquera", role = "aut"),
    person("Magdalena", "Nieto", role = "rtm"),
    person("Subnational Politics Project", role = "cph"))
Description: Download and explore the harmonized subnational political
    datasets of the Subnational Politics Project (SPP), covering executive
    politics, legislative composition, electoral dynamics, and subnational
    democracy in Argentina, Brazil, and Mexico. Datasets are fetched on
    demand from a GitHub Releases mirror and cached locally; the archival,
    citable copies live on Harvard Dataverse. A variable-level codebook is
    bundled for offline reference.
